{% doc %}
  Collection filter form (TE-6 AC2, AC4, ES1-T103 D5, D6). Reads the global
  `collection`. Works without JavaScript: the form submits with GET and the drawer
  is a native popover.

  Below 64rem the `dialog popover` is a drawer, opened by collection-filter-open
  in blocks/collection-products.liquid. From 64rem CSS turns it into the left
  column and hides the open and close buttons. assets/collection-filters.js (BE
  ES1-T110, ES1-T111) upgrades the drawer to showModal; its script tag goes in
  this block, outside the partial.

  The form sits outside the partial so its listeners survive an update. Partial
  collection-filters (name must match assets/collection-filters.js) wraps the
  groups and Clear all, inside the form. The sort select in
  blocks/collection-products.liquid joins this form through its form attribute.

  No filters (collection.filters is empty): the dialog stays in the page with
  `hidden`, so the form and the partial still exist and sort still submits. The
  theme editor shows a hint.

  JS hooks: form id collection-filter-form, dialog id collection-filter-drawer,
  on the form data-collection-id (empty on /collections/all; plain id, not a GID),
  data-collection-handle, data-products-count (all_products_count, before
  filtering) for shopify:collection:update (ES1-T104 #6). The form is novalidate:
  a price from the URL above range_max would otherwise block a submit silently
  inside the closed drawer. BE checks min and max before fetching (ES1-T111).

  Test hooks: collection-filters (root), collection-filter-drawer,
  collection-filter-close, collection-filter-form, collection-filter-apply,
  collection-filter-clear, and the hooks of snippets/filter-group.liquid.

  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'collection-main' %}
    <collection-filters class="collection-layout">
      {% block 'collection-filters' %}{% endblock %}
      {% block 'collection-products' %}{% endblock %}
    </collection-filters>
  {% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- if collection == blank -%}
  {%- if request.design_mode -%}
    <div class="collection-filters__hint" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
      {{ 'blocks.collection_filters.placeholder' | t }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    # Same rule as the badge in blocks/collection-products.liquid
    assign active_filter_count = 0
    for filter in collection.filters
      assign active_filter_count = active_filter_count | plus: filter.active_values.size
      if filter.type == 'price_range'
        if filter.min_value.value != nil or filter.max_value.value != nil
          assign active_filter_count = active_filter_count | plus: 1
        endif
      endif
    endfor
  -%}

  <div class="collection-filters" data-testid="collection-filters" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- if request.design_mode and collection.filters.size == 0 -%}
      <div class="collection-filters__hint">{{ 'blocks.collection_filters.no_filters' | t }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <dialog
      class="collection-filters__drawer"
      id="collection-filter-drawer"
      popover
      scroll-lock
      aria-labelledby="collection-filter-title"
      data-testid="collection-filter-drawer"
      {% if collection.filters.size == 0 %}
        hidden
      {% endif %}
    >
      <div class="collection-filters__header">
        <h2 class="collection-filters__title" id="collection-filter-title">
          {{- 'blocks.collection_filters.title' | t -}}
        </h2>
        <button
          class="collection-filters__close"
          type="button"
          popovertarget="collection-filter-drawer"
          popovertargetaction="hide"
          aria-label="{{ 'blocks.collection_filters.close' | t | escape }}"
          data-testid="collection-filter-close"
        >
          {% render 'header-icon', name: 'close' %}
        </button>
      </div>

      <form
        id="collection-filter-form"
        method="get"
        action="{{ collection.url }}"
        novalidate
        data-collection-id="{{ collection.id }}"
        data-collection-handle="{{ collection.handle | escape }}"
        data-products-count="{{ collection.all_products_count }}"
        data-testid="collection-filter-form"
      >
        {% partial 'collection-filters' %}
          <div class="collection-filters__groups">
            {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
              {% render 'filter-group', filter: filter %}
            {%- endfor -%}

            {%- if active_filter_count > 0 -%}
              <a class="collection-filters__clear" href="{{ collection.url }}" data-testid="collection-filter-clear">
                {{- 'blocks.collection_filters.clear_all' | t -}}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {% endpartial %}

        <button class="button collection-filters__apply" type="submit" data-testid="collection-filter-apply">
          {{- 'blocks.collection_filters.apply' | t -}}
        </button>
      </form>
    </dialog>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.collection_filters",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
